   "line": [
    "Rf3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The rook swings to f3 — not recapturing the knight, but going straight for f7. The catch is it isn't fully sound; there's a cold-blooded computer defence, though it's nearly impossible to find in blitz.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "a practical but unsound try"
   ]
